SUMMARY:Designing Soundscapes for Film
DESCRIPTION:Sound can be a powerful tool in narrative building\, and compelling stories can be told using the everyday sounds found around us. In this workshop\, discover the power of sound through first building your own sound library using unconventional materials and the environment around you and then designing interactive soundscapes like those used in video games\, virtual reality and interactive multimedia projects. Practice building storylines both physically and digitally\, and explore the potential of your own sound library.
LOCATION:Ithra Tower - Level 5\, Immersive Lab
